 child is not a camera\r\n - The arm is colliding\r\n\r\nThis would make the arm immediately jump to the margin position on collision. This pr always factors in the margin when determining the length. The margin also works now in the case that a shape is set or the child is a camera.\r\n\r\nSimilar to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/89797 this is technically a breaking change because the margin didn't do anything before in some cases and the default value is not 0. On the other hand the default margin is very small (0.01).\r\n\r\n__Example setup: ```margin == 1```, csgbox.size == 0.8\\*0.8\\*0.8__\r\n![2025-06-23_00-24](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e1f25b43-e371-4d4c-8399-be8eb117feed)\r\n\r\n__Old behaviour__:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2775f180-e2a1-41fd-8d76-5ce6f3334ee3\r\n\r\n__New behaviour__:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a2a2c55d-bbaf-4afe-9594-59b5488d0d3b\r\n\r\nSupersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/89797\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/76220","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github